# 22. Git Decision Cheat Sheet

| Situation                    | Command                        |
| ---------------------------- | ------------------------------ |
| Check repository state       | `git status`                   |
| See unstaged changes         | `git diff`                     |
| Save work temporarily        | `git stash`                    |
| Create a branch              | `git checkout -b feature-name` |
| Merge a branch               | `git merge feature-name`       |
| Keep history linear          | `git rebase master`            |
| Combine feature commits      | `git merge --squash`           |
| Take one specific commit     | `git cherry-pick <commit>`     |
| Undo local history           | `git reset`                    |
| Undo shared/pushed changes   | `git revert`                   |
| Find previous HEAD positions | `git reflog`                   |
| Download remote changes      | `git fetch`                    |
| Download + integrate changes | `git pull`                     |
| Send commits to remote       | `git push`                     |
| Create GitHub PR             | `gh pr create`                 |
| Check CI status              | `gh pr checks`                 |
| View workflow runs           | `gh run list`                  |

